{"seq":1,"slug":"sensor-fusion","title":"传感器融合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/systems/sensor-fusion","wordCount":1597,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"传感器融合\">传感器融合</h1><p>一只 <a href=\"../sensing/physical-quantity-sensing\">MEMS 陀螺仪</a>短时间内能精确测出角速度，但积分求姿态会随零偏漂移而越积越歪；一只加速度计能靠重力方向给出绝对姿态参考，却被运动加速度和振动污染得满是噪声。单独看，两者都不够；合起来——用陀螺的短期稳定补加速度的噪声、用加速度的长期绝对参考纠陀螺的漂移——却能得到比任何单一传感器都好的姿态估计。这就是传感器融合的核心思想：多个互补、有噪声、不完美的测量，经概率最优地组合，逼近真实状态。这一篇讲清融合的原理与从互补滤波到卡尔曼的主流算法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>融合要解决的根本矛盾是：每个传感器都只测到真实状态的一个带噪投影，没有一个直接给出你想要的量。融合用一个<strong>状态模型</strong>描述系统如何演化，用<strong>观测模型</strong>描述各传感器如何反映状态，再以概率方式加权组合。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  S1[陀螺 角速度&lt;br/&gt;短期准 长期漂] --&gt; FUS[融合估计器]&#10;  S2[加速度 重力参考&lt;br/&gt;有噪 长期准] --&gt; FUS&#10;  S3[磁力计 航向参考] --&gt; FUS&#10;  S4[GPS/视觉 位置参考] --&gt; FUS&#10;  MODEL[状态模型&lt;br/&gt;系统如何演化] --&gt; FUS&#10;  FUS --&gt; EST[最优状态估计&lt;br/&gt;姿态/位置/速度]&#10;  EST --&gt; PRED[预测下一步]&#10;  PRED --&gt; FUS\">flowchart TD\n  S1[陀螺 角速度&lt;br/&gt;短期准 长期漂] --&gt; FUS[融合估计器]\n  S2[加速度 重力参考&lt;br/&gt;有噪 长期准] --&gt; FUS\n  S3[磁力计 航向参考] --&gt; FUS\n  S4[GPS/视觉 位置参考] --&gt; FUS\n  MODEL[状态模型&lt;br/&gt;系统如何演化] --&gt; FUS\n  FUS --&gt; EST[最优状态估计&lt;br/&gt;姿态/位置/速度]\n  EST --&gt; PRED[预测下一步]\n  PRED --&gt; FUS</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>融合内容</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据级</td>\n<td>原始测量直接组合</td>\n<td>多麦克风波束成形</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特征级</td>\n<td>提取特征后融合</td>\n<td>视觉+激光雷达点云对齐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>决策级</td>\n<td>各传感器先判断再投票</td>\n<td>多冗余安全系统表决</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为什么要融合-互补-冗余与覆盖\">为什么要融合：互补、冗余与覆盖</h2><p>融合带来三类收益。<strong>互补性</strong> 是最常用的——不同传感器在不同时间尺度或维度上各有所长，组合后取长补短，IMU 姿态解算（陀螺+加速度+磁力计）是教科书案例。<strong>冗余性</strong> 提升可靠与精度：多个测同一量的传感器组合，既能在某个失效时继续工作（安全关键系统的核心要求），又能靠平均降低随机噪声。<strong>覆盖性</strong> 扩展感知范围：<a href=\"../sensing/photo-imaging-sensing\">摄像头</a>给语义、激光雷达给精确距离、毫米波雷达穿透雨雾，自动驾驶把它们融合成统一的环境模型。</p>\n<p>这三类收益解释了为什么<a href=\"../sensing/physical-quantity-sensing\">惯性传感</a>的零偏漂移痛点几乎必然导向融合：单靠陀螺无法长期可用，必须借一个长期绝对参考来约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"互补滤波-最朴素的融合\">互补滤波：最朴素的融合</h2><p>理解融合最好从互补滤波（complementary filter）入手，它直观且计算极省。思路是：对高频可信的传感器（陀螺）走高通、对低频可信的传感器（加速度）走低通，两路相加。姿态角估计可写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ω</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta = \\alpha\\,(\\theta_{prev} + \\omega_{gyro}\\,\\Delta t) + (1-\\alpha)\\,\\theta_{acc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">cc</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 接近 1（如 0.98）：绝大部分权重给陀螺积分（短期准），小部分用加速度计算的角度做缓慢纠偏（消除长期漂移）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 由两个传感器可信带宽的交界频率决定。互补滤波没有概率最优性，但在资源受限的<a href=\"iot-smart-sensing\">边缘传感节点</a>上以极低成本拿到「够用」的姿态，至今广泛使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"卡尔曼滤波-概率最优的融合\">卡尔曼滤波：概率最优的融合</h2><p>当需要最优估计且系统可建模时，<strong>卡尔曼滤波（KF）</strong> 是黄金标准。它把状态估计建成「预测—更新」的递归循环：用状态模型预测下一步状态及其不确定性（协方差），再用新到的测量按其不确定性加权地修正预测。核心是<strong>卡尔曼增益</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span>，它衡量「该多信任新测量、多信任预测」：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>P</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo></msubsup><msup><mi>H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>H</mi><msubsup><mi>P</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo></msubsup><msup><mi>H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_k = P_k^- H^\\top \\left(H P_k^- H^\\top + R\\right)^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4531em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4086em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2914em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4086em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2914em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1031em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.352em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>测量噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 越大，增益越小、越信预测；预测不确定性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越大，增益越大、越信测量。KF 在每一步都给出最小均方误差意义下的最优估计，还附带不确定性度量，这是它远超互补滤波的地方。</p>\n<p>线性高斯假设之外，现实系统多是非线性的（如姿态的三角关系、车辆运动学）。工程上用<strong>扩展卡尔曼滤波（EKF）</strong>（在工作点线性化）或<strong>无迹卡尔曼滤波（UKF）</strong>（用确定性采样点传播分布）处理非线性；当分布严重非高斯、多模态时则转向<strong>粒子滤波</strong>（用大量样本近似后验）。这套估计框架是无人机、机器人、组合导航（INS/GNSS）的共同地基。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>计算量</th>\n<th>最优性</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>互补滤波</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>资源受限、姿态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卡尔曼 KF</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>线性高斯最优</td>\n<td>可线性建模系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EKF/UKF</td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n<td>近最优</td>\n<td>一般非线性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>粒子滤波</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>任意分布</td>\n<td>强非线性多模态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工程要点与现代趋势\">工程要点与现代趋势</h2><p>融合落地有几个绕不开的实务。<strong>时间同步</strong>：各传感器采样时刻不一致会直接污染融合，需要硬件时间戳或软件对齐——这把问题拉回到<a href=\"../interface/adc-sampling\">接口与采样</a>的同步性。<strong>标定</strong>：传感器间的安装外参（相对位姿）与内参误差不校准，融合精度无从谈起，呼应<a href=\"../sensing/sensor-classification\">传感器特性</a>里的标定。<strong>噪声建模</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 与过程噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 的整定直接决定滤波器表现，常需实测整定。当前趋势是把传统贝叶斯滤波与学习方法结合——用神经网络估计噪声参数或直接做端到端融合，尤其在自动驾驶的多模态感知里。无论方法如何演进，融合让单只传感器的不完美被系统性弥补，这是它在<a href=\"iot-smart-sensing\">智能传感系统</a>里不可或缺的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>融合的核心：多个互补、有噪、不完美的测量经概率最优组合，逼近真实状态，胜过任何单一传感器。</li>\n<li>三类收益：互补（取长补短，IMU 姿态）、冗余（容错+降噪，安全系统）、覆盖（扩展感知，自动驾驶多传感器）。</li>\n<li>互补滤波用高/低通分频加权，计算极省、无最优性，适合资源受限边缘节点。</li>\n<li>卡尔曼滤波以「预测—更新」递归给出最优估计，卡尔曼增益按不确定性在预测与测量间加权；非线性用 EKF/UKF/粒子滤波。</li>\n<li>工程要点是时间同步、外参标定、噪声整定；融合系统性弥补了<a href=\"../sensing/physical-quantity-sensing\">惯性零偏</a>等单传感器缺陷，是<a href=\"iot-smart-sensing\">智能传感</a>的支柱。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"传感器融合","id":"传感器融合"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么要融合：互补、冗余与覆盖","id":"为什么要融合-互补-冗余与覆盖"},{"level":2,"text":"互补滤波：最朴素的融合","id":"互补滤波-最朴素的融合"},{"level":2,"text":"卡尔曼滤波：概率最优的融合","id":"卡尔曼滤波-概率最优的融合"},{"level":2,"text":"工程要点与现代趋势","id":"工程要点与现代趋势"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"液压与气动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/actuators/hydraulic-pneumatic"},"next":{"title":"MEMS 与微系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/systems/mems-microsystems"}}